<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 21 January <span class="n">9</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/erchanger-duke-of-swabia"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Erchanger, Duke of Swabia</span><span class="tp">d. 917</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/juan-de-grijalva"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/juan-de-grijalva.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Juan de Grijalva</span><span class="tp">c. 1490–1527</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/anthony-ashley-cooper-1st-earl-of-shaftesbury"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/anthony-ashley-cooper-1st-earl-of-shaftesbury.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Anthony Ashley Cooper, 1st Earl of Shaftesbury</span><span class="tp">1621–1683</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/louis-xvi"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/louis-xvi.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Louis XVI</span><span class="tp">1754–1793</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/franz-grillparzer"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/franz-grillparzer.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Franz Grillparzer</span><span class="tp">1791–1872</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ahmed-muhtar-pasha"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ahmed-muhtar-pasha.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Ahmed Muhtar Pasha</span><span class="tp">1839–1919</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/gojong-of-korea"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/gojong-of-korea.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Gojong of Korea</span><span class="tp">1852–1919</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/vladimir-lenin"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/vladimir-lenin.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Vladimir Lenin</span><span class="tp">1870–1924</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/george-washington-goethals"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/george-washington-goethals.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">George Washington Goethals</span><span class="tp">1858–1928</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
